{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38925","headline":"赠溧水崔少府 · 杜荀鹤","name":"赠溧水崔少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庭户萧条燕雀喧，日高窗下枕书眠。\n祗闻留客教沽酒，未省逢人说料钱。\n洞口礼星披鹤氅，溪头吟月上渔船。\n九华山叟心相许，不计官卑赠一篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}